    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6622dcad1e2be40d54dacc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪耀系列赛告一段落后的某一天。\n使用了在那天抽中的旅行券，\n来到了温泉旅行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a31916833ab3e0087fef3b460a5d59e339d6e298e3b1f9656a9c38fa9cd1b61d",
