    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f83d90a335bb4b2ca9d642",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵。在本馆，\n除了能从露天浴池欣赏到自然花卉，\n浴室内也装饰着季节性的鲜花哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1237698a345f397df8aa07d69b6577989393962131da575918770d2e31ad1d53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
