    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e8d6d85c09225da045c812",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从露天浴池望去的景色简直绝美。\n碧绿的溪流，以及在其周围盛开的野花——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e9f918985f232db48e265580393435ebf0cf691090ff055b4a5ba83c7f54305",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e14d2a605bb45ca82986a5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（要说能让她开心的东西，果然还是花）",
      "source_fingerprint": "71c9fe29f27b523d7da2dfe00c4d0ae342dd2e0287255ed5300ae7741fadc49a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a0d4014800e8a81a1fe732",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我由衷地庆幸抽中了温泉旅行券——\n忽然间，馆内的导览图映入眼帘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94523a29d1efcfc10d23ef12a6bd7b38eb297907346f4e86fde8a8768a8d544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1113bc60dac8501a15367fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个，打扰一下",
      "source_fingerprint": "147223137fecc6682c65dda8db14364f391e1e3d810e0337a58944da3e749f9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3ac2eccf81ee14300b7259d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使是手帕，\n只要是我送的她肯定都会开心，但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "461ae2fd8586698af1306a0a820241c4dc34b4493fafe0587432fca3f03d118d",
